<title>CANADA: SASKATCHEWAN AG DETAILS CROP PROGRESS TO AUG 10.</title>
<headline>SASKATCHEWAN AG DETAILS CROP PROGRESS TO AUG 10.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on</p>
<p>Tuesday detailed the level of crop growth to August 10.</p>
<p>CEREALS  SHOTBLADE  HEADED  DOUGH  RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 10     0 pct     2 pct  36 soft 13 pct</p>
<p>				    49 firm</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  1 pct    29 pct  67 pct   3 pct</p>
<p>CANOLA   ROSETTE  FLOWERED  PODDED  RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 10     0 pct     1 pct  76 pct  23 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  0 pct    17 pct  78 pct   5 pct</p>
<p>FALL CROPS DOUGH   RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 10     2 pct   98 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg 15 pct   85 pct</p>
<p>FLAX     TILLERED  FLOWERED BOLL   RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 10     0 pct    5 pct   89 pct   6 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg  1 pct   31 pct   67 pct   1 pct</p>
<p>PULSE CRP FLOWERED PODDED   RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 10/97  1 pct   51 pct   48 pct</p>
<p>Aug 12/96 14 pct   78 pct    8 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Reuters Winnipeg Bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
